WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:53.350
Someone once said...

00:01:53.350 --> 00:01:58.790
There are mellow acorns that 
taste like delicious drinks,

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:06.130
such as milk, cocoa, cream 
soda, and orange juice...

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:09.500
Drinkorns!

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.710
There are cosmos that bear

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:20.710
soft, fully ripened peaches 
full of rich fruit juice...

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:24.380
Cosmopeaches!

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:28.090
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:33.930
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.960
Supreme Chitose Ame!

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.100
Komatsu and Yun's Tale!

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:50.380
Um...

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:53.410
I know he told me to wait around here...

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.320
T-Taxi Sheep!

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.590
The Gourmet Shrine sent it over.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:01.050
Toriko-san!

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:02.660
Come on, let's go!

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:03.520
Okay!

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:08.260
Thank you!

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:13.030
So you said the Gourmet Shrine 
made a request to us directly?

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.030
It's the 7-5-3 children's 
festival today, right?

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:17.400
And apparently it's the 
duty of the Gourmet Man

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.740
to help celebrate it every year 
by handing out chitose ame!

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:22.570
Then this year, you and I have to...

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:26.710
Yep! Let's hand out yummy chitose 
ame to our heart's content!

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:27.410
Sure!

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:33.580
Hey! Why haven't we left yet?!

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.490
You've come to see us off?

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.770
Hey! Wait a second! You're coming with us?!

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:07.420
In the end, you came with, huh?

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:11.490
Strange...

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:12.860
Is something wrong?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:14.220
As I recall,

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.990
chitose ame candy from the Gourmet Shrine

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:21.060
has so many sweet flavors, textures, 
and scents packed in there

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:25.800
that it's supposed to last for thousands, 
no, tens of thousand of years...

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:29.210
But I'm not smellin' any 
sweet scents right now.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:35.610
Now that you mention it, I'm not seeing 
any 7-5-3 festival banners or signs...

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.080
Well, anyway, a Gourmet Man can't carry 
out his duties on an empty stomach.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:44.290
Hmm... What would be good?

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.090
Good thinking!

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.400
Gourmet Shrine talismans!

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.160
Cool!

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.670
Mont Blanc Ramen!

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.280
Delicious!

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:12.980
Noodles kneaded from the 
fruit of Gourmet Trees

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.650
exquisitely covered in piping hot honey soup!

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.490
Sweet ramen that looks exactly 
like Mont Blanc cake!

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:20.720
The Gourmet Trees' Mont Blanc Ramen!

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:21.960
You want some, Komatsu?!

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:24.090
It does look delicious!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.060
Wait here a second.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:26.830
Welcome!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.830
I'll have one bowl of 
Mont Blanc Ramen, please!

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:30.600
Um, a small bowl...

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.000
You got it!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.670
Thanks, come again!

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:09.740
Alright, let's go!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.170
That was yummy!

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:14.410
He may be remembering what 
happened at Ice Hell.

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:24.050
Are you hungry?

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:27.190
Here. It's got the delicious 
fruit of Gourmet Trees in it.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:31.320
Was it too hot?! Sorry about that!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.330
You like cool stuff better, right?

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:46.770
I know! How about eating cold 
Dried Persimmon Shaved Ice?

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.840
You're here?

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:53.580
What?

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.750
Father Papo is waiting for you. Come quickly!

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.620
There is no chitose ame?!

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.020
I'm so sorry.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:10.130
Normally, we would have asked you 
here to pass out the chitose ame.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.360
W-What do you mean?!

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:15.030
Actually, we lack the materials 
to make the chitose ame.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:18.500
A certain ingredient 
hasn't been procured yet.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:22.570
I see. And you called us here to capture it?

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:24.540
I'm sorry.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.080
We did everything we could to 
get it, right up to now, but...

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.410
So what is the ingredient?

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:30.750
Longevity Cane.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:31.920
Longevity Cane?!

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:36.590
Its sap is ten million times 
sweeter than sugarcane

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:39.060
and just one stalk can 
make a rod of chitose ame

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:41.320
long enough to go around 
the world a thousand times!

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:44.990
The Gourmet Shrine receives a 
tremendous amount of visitors

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:48.800
and we don't have enough chitose 
ame prepared to go around.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:53.770
With its colors boding good fortune 
and taste that everyone loves,

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:56.240
it's a precious ingredient.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.940
If I recall, it only grows 
in a place where the ground

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:05.150
is cold and damp, but the 
sun shines intensely.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:08.150
Sounds like it has a really 
high Capture Level.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:12.150
Even so, for many years, 
we managed to keep a stalk.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:15.290
However, we ran out of stock...

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:17.860
We simply must prepare enough chitose ame

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:21.560
for all of the children and 
parents who are here today.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:27.700
But you two Gourmet Men are our last hope.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.940
Alright, I'll capture it!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:33.270
Thank you!

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:37.180
Making chitose ame depends on the 
capture of that Longevity Cane, huh?

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.910
As we're in a great hurry, we'll 
get ready for the visitors.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:43.120
In that case, I'll help you 
prepare to make the candy.

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.020
Then I'll take you to the workshop.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:49.690
Toriko-san, I'll be waiting for 
exceptionally sweet Longevity Cane, okay?

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:50.360
Sure!

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:02.300
Acacia-sama, please protect them.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:16.480
Oh, sorry. After I'm done 
here, we can play, alright?

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:42.070
Cane sugar, the sweet component of sugarcane,

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:44.040
is made from photosynthesis in leaves.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.050
For the sugar content of 
Longevity Cane to rise,

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:49.710
the temperature has to drop, 
the plant's growth stops,

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:54.590
with only the cane sugar 
in the stalk accumulating.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.890
Plenty of sun along with a low temperature...

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.060
Nothing like that fits the bill in this area.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:05.100
All kinds of scents are mixed 
together in the forest.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.500
I just want to track sweet aromas,

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.700
but it seems like finding 'em 
ain't gonna be an easy job.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:29.750
Alright! Everything is set.

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:31.920
Now all I have to do is wait for Toriko-san

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:34.060
to come back with the Longevity Cane...

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:41.660
Huh? Where'd you go?! Hey!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:45.770
Um, did you happen to see the 
Wall Penguin child I was with?

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:48.300
Huh? I think he was over there...

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:50.540
Thank you!

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:54.440
Where is he?!

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:18.030
Where did he go by himself?!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.040
Hey!

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.020
That scared me!

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:41.760
The forest is so thick 
that it's darker in here.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.490
I have to find him fast!

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:22.550
So what is the ingredient?

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:24.060
Longevity Cane.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:25.520
Longevity Cane?!

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:37.570
Tengu Eagle (Avian Beast) Capture Level 30

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:48.010
How far did he go?!

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:50.180
That voice...

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:55.550
Where are you?! It's me!

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:57.290
Can you hear me?!

00:13:58.090 --> 00:13:59.920
Hey!

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:04.030
What should I do?!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:11.070
That's right. Maybe he would more easily 
recognize the sound of his own call.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:27.820
Voices...

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.250
Uh-oh...

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.450
I smell a Beast.

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:54.380
Highly-concentrated sweetness 
and high in nutrients...

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:57.880
It's a favorite ingredient 
of Beasts and insects, too...

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:04.750
Making chitose ame depends on the 
capture of that Longevity Cane, huh?

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:30.810
Yun!

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:01.670
Are you okay?!

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:02.880
Toriko-san!

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:07.650
That was dangerous for you to 
come all the way out here alone.

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.190
That's...

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.360
...Longevity Cane!

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:22.330
Were you looking for this?

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.030
For me...?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.070
Thank you!

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:35.370
Yun!

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:39.010
Thank you so much!

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.780
Thank you!

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:20.640
There you go!

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:21.340
Here you are!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.650
Come, both of you Gourmet Men as well...

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:29.050
We can eat it, too?!

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:30.220
Of course!

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:32.650
Much obliged!

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:33.950
All righty...

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:37.690
I give thanks for all of 
this world's bounty...

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:39.090
Thank you!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.730
Thank you!

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:45.970
It's delicious!

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:54.870
It's by turns fruity and fragrant,

00:18:54.870 --> 00:18:57.840
with a creamy richness 
and a simple sweetness!

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.850
Kudos to the Longevity Cane!

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:02.650
There are all kinds of 
flavors packed in there!

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.880
It's because of you, Yun. Thank you.

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:07.590
This is...

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:10.820
It melts smoothly the moment 
you put it in your mouth!

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:13.860
Even though it sparkles like a gem...

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:16.460
I've never had chitose ame like this before!

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:17.800
Actually...

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.570
A Diamond Fig Crystal!

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.740
Yes. It's a piece of the 
fruit that Melk-san shared

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.410
from last week's Gourmet Service Tournament.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:29.070
One more time! Delicious!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.080
I made it special for you.

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:43.720
Is it good?

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:47.660
The strength of extraordinary Gourmet Luck

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:50.030
and a generous, sharing heart...

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:53.600
I'm grateful to the two Gourmet Men.

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:56.130
Though it's not only those two...

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.140
What do you saw we go home, too?

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.880
You both possess incredible Gourmet Luck.

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.820
I'm lookin' forward to whatever comes next.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.450
Me too, Yun-Yun-Yun!

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:32.890
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:36.830
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:41.840
We're going to use a camera this 
week too, so get yours ready!

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:45.210
Okay, please choose one 
of these three platters.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:49.210
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:53.280
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:21:54.110 --> 00:21:56.180
Alright, here we go!

00:21:56.180 --> 00:22:01.050
A heaping helping... Open!

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:04.820
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:12.570
A - Chicken Tiger Capture Level > 50

00:22:06.390 --> 00:22:07.990
...yours if you chose A!

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:10.260
Things will go great with 
your hobbies and studies!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:12.570
Maybe the people around you 
will even pay you compliments!

00:22:12.570 --> 00:22:21.770
C - Gator Shark Capture Level 27

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:16.740
If you chose C, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:19.910
Even if you fail, you'll be okay, as 
long as you don't let it get you down!

00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:21.770
Don't give in even one gram!

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:30.750
B - Swamp Eel Capture Level 18

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:26.110
And I'm sorry. If you chose B, you're third.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.080
Being too greedy is forbidden!

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:30.750
Only narrow in on what's important to you!

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:34.550
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:34.550 --> 00:22:36.290
Are you ready?

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:41.390
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:37.720
If you take a photo of the scene,

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:41.390
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:43.200
Alright, here we go!

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:47.530
3... 2... 1... Scoop Chance!

00:22:48.070 --> 00:22:51.400
With food,

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:54.340
it's better to share

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:57.140
than to be greedy!

00:22:58.110 --> 00:23:00.240
That's right! You should share!

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:02.610
Scoops, too! Letters of apology, too!

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:04.620
Now, let's go on to our next segment!

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:08.820
Autumn means it's time to hunt seasonal specialties.

00:23:09.020 --> 00:23:12.740
Which team will capture the legendary pear? Let the game begin!

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:16.690
Assemble On Autumn Mountain! Terry, Yun, Kiss, Queen!

00:23:16.860 --> 00:23:18.670
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
